  #codepenchallenge, #cpc-multiple-choice
  
  > Make sure you try all the seasons and types of glasses, etc.
  > Groot will sleep if you don't move the mouse for a period of time.
  > Try clicking directly on Groot for an explosive effect.
  > Try juggling the penguins in Winter - they look so cute :p
  > Juggle the knives at your own risk :D
  > To feed Groot hold the spoon up to his mouth.
  > Click on Drink a few times and you'll get different colored cups.
  
